parametersJson.description:
JSON object containing input values required by the selected NLP.

Examples:

1. Sleep:
   {"seconds":10}

2. Enter text:
   {"input":"admin@example.com"}

3. Verify text:
   {"expectedText":"Welcome"}

4. Multiple inputs:
   {"username":"admin","password":"secret123"}

Use the exact input names returned by fireflink_get_nlp_details.
Pass values as valid JSON. Do not include elementName or elementType here; those are separate arguments.
